{"id": "P1", "source_run": "sim-r1", "at": "2026-11-17T21:38:24+0800", "situation": "競品網站的 sitemap 有上千個以關鍵字命名的商業頁面（例如博弈、貸款類），主體卻是體育或新聞內容；網域註冊日很新，但 Wayback 有更早的存檔。要判斷它的關鍵字頁怎麼做，以及網域是否承接舊站。", "route": "1. sitemap_tree：先 build 再看分區與 sample，因為能知道哪個資料夾佔大宗、網址 slug 是否直接用關鍵字與長尾變體\n2. inspect_page：讀指定關鍵字的專屬頁（title、H1/H2、FAQ、JSON-LD），因為能核對結構是否為模板並看 schema 是否錯置\n3. inspect_page：用 link_filter 篩外部網域看 rel 與追蹤參數，因為摘要只列主機，不一定看得到 rel 或 st 參數\n4. wayback：snapshot 抓註冊日前的首頁再 inspect_page，因為 RDAP 註冊日只代表最近一次註冊，需用舊內容確認前身", "result": "照走", "avoid_reason": "", "paired_id": "", "evidence_ids": ["E-0104", "E-0116", "E-0108", "E-0111", "E-0113", "E-0114", "E-0106"], "route_tools": [{"tool": "sitemap_tree", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0104"], "call_n": 4}, {"tool": "wayback", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0106"], "call_n": 5}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0108"], "call_n": 6}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "web.archive.org", "path": "/web/20241228055346id_/https://2030.tw/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0106"], "call_n": 7}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0111"], "call_n": 8}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0108", "E-0113"], "call_n": 10}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0114"], "call_n": 11}, {"tool": "sitemap_tree", "domain": null, "path": null, "evidence_ids": ["E-0116"], "call_n": 13}]}
